@startuml
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Submitted : create confession
Submitted --> Matched : similar confession found
Submitted --> Unmatched : no match yet
Matched --> Chatting : users start conversation
Chatting --> RevealRequested : one user requests reveal
RevealRequested --> ContactExchangeActive : both users accept
ContactExchangeActive --> Revealed : profiles visible
Matched --> Closed : match deactivated or ignored
Unmatched --> Closed
Revealed --> Closed
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
